  "hard_rules": [
    "Every required microstep emits one ScorecardRow.",
    "Missing required artifact emits FAIL, never omission.",
    "NOT_RUN is allowed only when a prior required dependency failed.",
    "UNKNOWN on a required microstep is release-blocking.",
    "Overall apps_rg score is blocked until required microstep coverage is complete.",
    "Suite and dimension scorecards are never sufficient for apps_rg.",
    "Lane rows are mandatory for all generated lanes.",
    "X2, X1D, X3, and L6 rows are mandatory per generated lane.",
    "apps_eval audits apps_rg X3 proof and does not replace it.",
